  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "How can we stop climate change?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "How can we live on a green planet?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Scientists agree that one way is to use clean energy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Opposite to the use of fossil fuels, using clean energy does not produce harmful litter.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "We just need to learn how to get and store more of it.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Plants can help us learn how to make clean energy, which could have a huge effect on our planet.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The sun is a primary source of energy for plants.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "They use sunlight to turn water and air into sugar.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "The sugar can be used as food.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The aim of some scientists is to get energy from the sun, like plants do.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "During the day and especially around noon, they can gather plenty of sunlight.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "They want to make a machine that can use the sunlight to make fuel from water, which will allow us to use clean energy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Water is made up of two different parts.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Breaking water into its parts is hard.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Plants do it all the time though.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "With energy from the sun, the new machine will break water into its parts.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "One of the parts will be used as fuel.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Then the fuel is used to make electric power.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "The electricity can power cars, houses, our laptops, and so on.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "This fuel is better for the earth than gasoline or gas.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Burning gasoline produces pollution.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Scientists warn that if we do not act, climate change could lead to disasters and put our planet at risk.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "We need to balance traditional energy with clean energy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-23.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "By using clean energy and lending support to its development, we can protect our planet and ensure that future generations have the energy they need.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-24.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
